  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">The force between the two charges when they are placed in&nbsp;dielectric is</span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><msub><mi>&#949;</mi><mi>o</mi></msub><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfrac><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo></mrow><msup><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></math></span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">The force&nbsp;between the two charges&nbsp;when they are placed at separation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>d</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></math>&nbsp;is</span></span></span></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><msub><mi>&#949;</mi><mi>o</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><msup><mo>&#39;</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo></math></p><p>Since, the force between the two charges is same in both case</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><msub><mi>&#949;</mi><mi>o</mi></msub><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo></mrow><msup><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><msub><mi>&#949;</mi><mi>o</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><msup><mo>&#39;</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>&#39;</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi><msqrt><mi>k</mi></msqrt></math></p>"
